# The VSIX is an allow-list: exclude every path, then include what the installed extension uses.
# vsce adds package.json and README.md on its own. Order does not matter to vsce.
**

!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
!package.nls*.json

# Bundles built by esbuild.js; the prepublish step cleans out/ and builds without source maps.
!out/
# Runtime translation bundles (manifest "l10n")
!l10n/

!resources/icon.png
!resources/webview-icon.svg
!resources/webview-icon-dark.svg
!resources/webview-icon-light.svg

# Only the user guide ships from docs/: the Learn more command opens it in the installed extension.
!docs/git-actions.md
!walkthroughs/
